50	/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ *
51	 * CARD AUTO-CHARGE + DUNNING
52	 *
53	 * A renewal applies wallet credit FIRST and auto-charges the saved card for the
54	 * remainder — the same split `lib/wallet-split.ts` gives checkout, so a renewal
55	 * behaves exactly like a purchase and prepaid/referral/refund credit gets drained
56	 * instead of accumulating as a liability.
57	 *
58	 * When the card fails the customer is NOT suspended. The card is retried on days
59	 * 1, 3 and 5 past expiry, each with its own email, and only once every attempt is
60	 * spent — plus one clear day after the final notice — does the server pause. The
61	 * old behaviour sent a customer with a perfectly good card straight to SUSPENDED
62	 * the moment their wallet emptied, and told them about it with nothing but a bell
63	 * icon in a portal they had stopped visiting.
64	 * ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
