66	/**
67	 * Days past expiry for retry N (1-based): 1, 3, 5 …
68	 *
69	 * Derived from DUNNING_RETRY_ATTEMPTS — the same constant `emails.paymentRetryFailed`
70	 * uses to tell the customer how many attempts remain — so the schedule the worker
71	 * runs and the number in the email can never drift apart.
72	 */
